0 FILE 6056 - Dragon Wagon.ldr
0 A castle-themed dragon wagon pulled by winged horses, featuring a red wagon body with a hinged latch mechanism, a fully assembled green dragon with flame element, and two dragon-emblazoned minifigures serving as guardsman and coachman.
